<title>GERMANY: German Ifo climate index shows strong rise in January.</title>
<headline>German Ifo climate index shows strong rise in January.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Ifo economic institute said on Thursday its west German business climate index jumped to 93.3 in January from 90.9 in December, indicating that business confidence was increasing.</p>
<p>The same index for east Germany showed a rise to 106.7 from 104.1 in December.</p>
</text>
